1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Sign in to your workspace.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
One account can work as teacher or methodist.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Open a course to continue preparing its programme.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Keep course details and workload together.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Use lectures, notebooks and other teaching materials.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Open an existing draft and review its text.

7
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Check the competencies attached to this draft.

8
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Send the programme for review.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Switch to the methodist's review queue.

10
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Review the programme and its learning outcomes.

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Check competencies before making a decision.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Confirm the review and see coverage across the programme.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Download the reviewed programme as a Word document.
